---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <Verticalgrid />
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 mx-auto py-12 lg:py-24  space-y-24">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm text-transparent uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text">
          Full Marketing Automation for eCommerce and Retail Businesses
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-8">
        Smart Workflows with Proven Outcomes for Hike
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Develop AI-driven workflows to improve user engagement, retention, and acquisition. Expand your store and increase revenue through automated loyalty marketing strategies.
        </br>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative items-center pb-0 mx-auto mt-12 overflow-hidden max-w-7xl lg:p-10 lg:pb-14 "
        style="">
        <img
          class="object-cover -mb-12  rounded-xl border-white/5 lg:rounded-3xl shadow-vulcan-950"
          src="/assets/homepage/Workflow1.webp" width="1072" height="619"
          alt="Workflows for Hike POS"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 mt-24 lg:text-left sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12"
        role="list">
         <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="font-medium text-4xl">
              Integrate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base ">
            Effortlessly link your Hike POS with top eCommerce platforms and apps to create customized workflows. Craft smooth and effective customer experiences with ease, requiring just a few clicks.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-medium text-4xl">
              Automate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
Create custom workflows to launch sophisticated, data-driven marketing campaigns. Seamlessly integrate features like store credit, coupons, gift cards, and digital wallets into comprehensive workflows designed to attract, convert, and retain customers.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="font-medium text-4xl">
              Personalize</h3>           
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base ">
            Create fully automated, data-centric campaigns specifically designed for your customers. Deliver personalized incentives tailored to each customer's behavior and profile, such as rewards, cashbacks, loyalty points, coupons, gift cards, and store credits, to boost engagement and foster loyalty.
          </p>
        </li>
       
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
